\f0\b \cf0 Risk:
\f1\b0  the jet was set up for a 160 Hz tube. If voices don't sound at these high pitches, or they squeal, set 
\f0\b transpose
\f1\b0  to 0.5 or 0.25 first, then raise the air floor.\
The Max Console will show more "reduced number of modes" warnings at these pitches. They're harmless.\
